# Pairs with BackupSagaConsistent. REPRODUCES PRODUCTION BEFORE THE #4485 FIX:
# the snapshot path discarded the registry decisions, so a bucket still pending
# was served pre-saga whatever was decided. A capture taken while a committed
# saga's terminal fan-out is half done then holds one shard post-saga
# (terminal applied) and another pre-saga (bucket pending). Confirmed by
# execution against production; see the issue. Its code analogue (a leaf fold
# that skips SnapshotProjectionFolder.ResolvePendingAgainst) turns
# SnapshotCaptureSagaAtomicityTests red.
MODULE: BackupSagaConsistentPendingReadsPre
TARGET: BackupSagaConsistent
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a still-pending bucket is served pre-saga regardless of the decision (#4485)

--- FIND
         THEN (CASE d0[TreeOf[sh]][t] = "committed" -> "post"
                 [] d0[TreeOf[sh]][t] = "indeterminate" -> "absent"
                 [] OTHER -> "pre")
--- REPLACE
         \* MUTATION: the decision snapshot is never consulted.
         THEN "pre"
--- END
